flowchart TD
  IN[Intent + Cap] --> V{verify Cap}
  V -->|fail| AR[authority_refusal
zero Ops · zero cause]
  V -->|ok| B[BoundAsk token]
  B --> O{once / idempotency}
  O -->|store down / once replay| AR2[refuse]
  O -->|duplicate bind| PR[replay prior Result digest]
  O -->|ok| T[reload truth from Host store]
  T --> D[dispatch]
  D -->|miss| DE[dispatch error]
  D -->|ok| LIN{revocable or endable?}
  LIN -->|yes| REC[commit lineage
authorized Ops + reverse class]
  LIN -->|no| PROJ
  REC --> PROJ[project Ops
profile union Baseline]
  PROJ --> OUT[Result]
